      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewCard.tsx",
      "content": "`listShown` does not account for which panel is open. With no missing Marks or settlement, opening Reflections (including the default opening when reflections are due) hides the Action panel and its decision list, but also suppresses `LastDecisionLine`. The card then shows neither representation of the previous decision. Include `open === 'Action'` in the visibility calculation, and cover switching between Reflections and Action in the integration test.",
      "existing_code": "  const listShown = panelOf(progress, 'Marks').needed === 0 \u0026\u0026 settlementOf(progress) === undefined;",
