      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/app.css",
      "content": "`--warning-line` (#b26b00) has only about 3.7:1 contrast against this panel's `--tint` background (#f3efe6), below WCAG AA's 4.5:1 requirement for normal-sized text. Both the held-past-target message and missed-review messages use normal-sized text; font weights of 650/700 do not make them large text. Use a darker warning text color that meets 4.5:1 on both the panel and card backgrounds.",
      "existing_code": ".last-decisions-held[data-line='target'] {\n  color: var(--warning-line);\n}\n.last-decisions-missed {\n  color: var(--warning-line);",
